                                "sense_id": "92d14e38-b435-3a18-be0b-8a4d131dcae1",
                                "text": "On 17 August 2005, a Saab 2000, at the ramp, with controls locked, was subjected to jet blast of around 126 kt (233 km/h) from a passing B747. This resulted in the bending of the left aileron control pushrod, causing it to fail at the time of takeoff. The crew had to make an emergency landing."
